---
import { Icon } from "astro-icon/components";
---

<section class="relative py-32 bg-[#050505] overflow-hidden border-t border-white/5">
  <!-- Subtle Background Grid/Noise -->
  <div class="absolute inset-0 opacity-[0.02]" style="background-image: linear-gradient(rgba(255,255,255,0.1) 1px, transparent 1px), linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(255,255,255,0.1) 1px, transparent 1px); background-size: 40px 40px;"></div>

  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-6 relative z-10">
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-2 gap-16 lg:gap-24 items-center">
      
      <!-- Typography / Content Side -->
      <div class="space-y-10" data-aos="fade-right">
        <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-4">
          <div class="w-12 h-[1px] bg-blue-500"></div>
          <span class="text-xs font-mono uppercase tracking-[0.3em] text-white/50">Biz Kimiz?</span>
        </div>

        <h2 class="text-5xl md:text-6xl font-black uppercase tracking-tighter leading-[0.9]">
          Sıradanlığı <br/>
          <span class="text-transparent bg-clip-text bg-gradient-to-r from-blue-400 to-purple-500">Reddeden</span><br/>
          Bir Ajans.
        </h2>

        <div class="space-y-6 text-lg text-white/60 font-light leading-relaxed">
          <p>
            Evolution Ajans, markaların dijital ekosistemde hayatta kalmasını değil, o ekosistemi domine etmesini sağlayan yeni nesil bir kreatif ve teknoloji stüdyosudur.
          </p>
          <p>
            Verinin gücünü, estetiğin zarafetiyle birleştiriyor; sadece güzel görünen değil, gerçekten "çalışan" ve dönüşüm getiren sistemler inşa ediyoruz.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="pt-4">
          <a href="/hakkimizda" class="group inline-flex items-center gap-4 text-sm font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-white border-b border-white/20 pb-2 hover:border-blue-400 hover:text-blue-400 transition-colors">
            Hikayemizi Keşfedin
            <Icon name="mdi:arrow-right" size={20} class="group-hover:translate-x-2 transition-transform" />
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Visual / Abstract Side -->
      <div class="relative h-[500px] rounded-[3rem] bg-[#0a0a0a] border border-white/5 overflow-hidden flex items-center justify-center group" data-aos="fade-left">
        <!-- Glowing Orb -->
        <div class="absolute w-64 h-64 bg-blue-600/30 rounded-full blur-[80px] group-hover:bg-purple-600/30 transition-colors duration-1000"></div>
        
        <!-- Stats Grid Overlay -->
        <div class="relative z-10 grid grid-cols-2 gap-px bg-white/5 p-px rounded-2xl backdrop-blur-sm">
          
          <div class="bg-[#0a0a0a] p-8 flex flex-col justify-center items-center text-center rounded-tl-2xl hover:bg-white/5 transition-colors">
            <span class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-black text-white mb-2">5+</span>
            <span class="text-[10px] font-mono uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-white/40">Yıllık Tecrübe</span>
          </div>
          
          <div class="bg-[#0a0a0a] p-8 flex flex-col justify-center items-center text-center rounded-tr-2xl hover:bg-white/5 transition-colors">
            <span class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-black text-white mb-2">360°</span>
            <span class="text-[10px] font-mono uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-white/40">Tam Hizmet</span>
          </div>
          
          <div class="bg-[#0a0a0a] p-8 flex flex-col justify-center items-center text-center rounded-bl-2xl hover:bg-white/5 transition-colors">
            <span class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-black text-white mb-2">%100</span>
            <span class="text-[10px] font-mono uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-white/40">Performans</span>
          </div>
          
          <div class="bg-[#0a0a0a] p-8 flex flex-col justify-center items-center text-center rounded-br-2xl hover:bg-white/5 transition-colors">
            <span class="w-12 h-12 flex items-center justify-center bg-blue-500/20 text-blue-400 rounded-full mb-2">
              <Icon name="mdi:rocket-launch" size={24} />
            </span>
            <span class="text-[10px] font-mono uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-white/40">İnovasyon</span>
          </div>

        </div>
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>
</section>